WEBVTT

00:05:58.263 --> 00:06:00.463
because it's not going
to automatically happen.

00:06:00.497 --> 00:06:01.663
One of the ideas I have

00:06:01.697 --> 00:06:03.863
is just jot down at the end of every day

00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:06.130
a sentence of what worked
and what didn't work.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:08.263
And you don't have to look
at it for a month.

00:06:08.263 --> 00:06:11.663
But when you look back, over a month,
you want to look for,

00:06:11.697 --> 00:06:12.930
"Wow, that was surprising.

00:06:12.963 --> 00:06:15.930
I didn’t really think
that would be as effective as it is.”

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.663
Or maybe it would be, like,
"We keep trying to have

00:06:18.663 --> 00:06:20.763
this in-person meeting in Zoom,

00:06:20.797 --> 00:06:21.963
and it turns out

00:06:21.997 --> 00:06:25.397
that there's 14 people on the call
and only two of them are talking.

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:26.963
Maybe it's an email."

00:06:27.897 --> 00:06:32.163
So we have to rethink all of the ways,
not just the work we're doing,